    <briefdescription>
<para>Monte Carlo pricing engine for discrete arithmetic average price Asian. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Monte Carlo pricing engine for discrete arithmetic average price Asian options. It can use MCDiscreteGeometricAPEngine (Monte Carlo discrete arithmetic average price engine) and AnalyticDiscreteGeometricAveragePriceAsianEngine (analytic discrete arithmetic average price engine) for control variation.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000089"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
